<title>USA: Revere revises contained copper, zinc values.</title>
<headline>Revere revises contained copper, zinc values.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revere Copper Products adjusted its published base prices for its copper and alloy mill products to reflect a one cent increase in the copper price to $1.29 a lb and an 11-cent increase in zinc prices to $1.03 a lb.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Service, 212-859-1646))</p>
